nager's popout, opens as a tab in the current window instead, and the extension can still find, move and close it as its own window. A requested window state is ignored. A request no Space can host fails with an error. |"],[271,"| Feature     | In Crest                                                                                                                                                                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Side panels | `chrome.sidePanel` opens as a card beside the page it belongs to. The action's context menu, an icon click set to open the panel, and `sidePanel.open()` and `close()` all reach that card. |"],[274,"| Feature    | In Crest                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------